3. Seed stability over 10 seeds

   in-distribution coverage : 0.887 +/- 0.012
   operator-shift coverage  : 0.738 +/- 0.022
   paired drop (within seed): 0.149 +/- 0.021   (min 0.113)

   The paired drop is the quantity with power: seed-to-seed variation
   is common to both arms and cancels. A drop whose spread is small
   relative to its mean is a real effect, not a lucky split.

